/* 四个半日/一日城镇小节日 × 5 段 + 1 Hub = 21 段（2/2 烛光暖窖日、5/1 五月花柱集、8/1 初穗尝新会、11/22 封港修船日） */
:: MP Town Festivals 3 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
<<set _m to Time.date.month>><<set _d to Time.date.day>>
高街布告栏侧下方的木槽里挂着四枚记载半日节令的黄铜小牌：二月二日的烛光暖窖日、五月一日的五月花柱集、八月一日的初穗尝新会，以及十一月二十二日的封港修船日。塞拉替你指了指牌背上的集合地点，说这些半天就散的街坊节令最能看出镇上的老习俗。
<<if not ((_m is 1 and _d gte 30) or (_m is 2 and _d lte 5) or (_m is 4 and _d gte 27) or (_m is 5 and _d lte 4) or (_m is 7 and _d gte 28) or (_m is 8 and _d lte 4) or (_m is 11 and _d gte 19 and _d lte 25))>>
	铜牌背面还没有新的集合记号，最近的一场半日节令要再等些日子。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回小节令水牌前 (0:02)|MP Micro Festivals Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[查看下一排半日节令铜牌 (0:02)|MP Town Festivals 4 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if (_m is 1 and _d gte 30) or (_m is 2 and _d lte 5)>>
	<<templeicon>><<link [[烛光暖窖日：神殿地窖余蜡 (0:04)|MP Festival Candle 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_m is 4 and _d gte 27) or (_m is 5 and _d lte 4)>>
	<<parkicon>><<link [[五月花柱集：草坪花环彩带 (0:04)|MP Festival Maypole 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if (_m is 7 and _d gte 28) or (_m is 8 and _d lte 4)>>
	<<tendingicon>><<link [[初穗尝新会：农场头茬麦穗 (0:04)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if _m is 11 and _d gte 19 and _d lte 25>>
	<<link [[封港修船日：旧港松脂船底 (0:04)|MP Festival Careen 1]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

/* ==================== 1. 烛光暖窖日 (2月2日 · Candle · 5段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Candle 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
二月初的寒气仍未褪尽，狼街神殿下方的储藏地窖里点起了一排铜火盆。按照烛光暖窖日的旧例，乔丹正带着年轻修士清点过冬剩下的蜂蜡块，准备重铸成新烛分给孤儿院与守夜岗棚。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回狼街神殿前庭 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[帮乔丹刮净蜂蜡块的炭灰 (0:08)|MP Festival Candle 2]]>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_wax"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_wax"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[按粗细裁齐亚麻烛芯线 (0:07)|MP Festival Candle 2]]>>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_wax"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_wax"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Candle 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
融蜡铜锅架上炭火后，地窖里弥漫开温润的松脂与蜂蜜香气。就在往锡模里浇注第一批蜡液时，地窖北侧的通风木百叶被阵风吹开，冷空气直吹模具，再不挡住就会让新烛裂出空腔。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回神殿地窖阶梯 (0:02)|Temple]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[用厚麻布帘罩住冷却锡模 (0:06)|MP Festival Candle 3]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_mold"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_mold"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[搬来备用炭盆稳住室温 (0:06)|MP Festival Candle 3]]>>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_mold"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_mold"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Candle 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
午后你拎着刚脱模的两篮蜂蜡新烛来到高街面包房。师傅正在烤制暖窖日特供的蜂蜜燕麦圆饼，准备随新烛一起送到孤儿院，但案板上的野蜂蜜罐被冻得凝结成块，一时间化不开。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[走出面包房回高街 (0:02)|High Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[隔着温水盆慢慢搅化冻蜜 (0:07)|MP Festival Candle 4]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_cake"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_cake"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[把蜜罐挪到烤炉顶层回温 (0:06)|MP Festival Candle 4]]>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_cake"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["candle_cake"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Candle 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
暮色初临时，你与林恩、罗宾一起给宅邸街和孤儿院走廊的风灯换上新铸的蜂蜡烛。
<<if $mpFestival3Clues["candle_wax"] is 1 and $mpFestival3Clues["candle_mold"] is 1>>
新烛烛芯笔直，点亮后火苗明亮温和，连一滴多余的蜡泪都没有流下。<span class="green">整条街巷的防风灯都换上了耐烧的新烛。</span>
<<else>>
有几支蜡烛带了细微气孔，你耐心地替每盏风灯调低了挡风玻罩。<span class="teal">昏黄烛光稳稳亮了起来。</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回宅邸街步道 (0:02)|Domus Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[端着蜂蜜麦饼回孤儿院 (0:05)|MP Festival Candle 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Candle 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
孤儿院饭堂里点起了暖黄的蜂蜡烛，孩子们围坐着分食香甜的蜂蜜燕麦饼。乔丹把神殿结余的铸烛劳务补贴交到你手里，罗宾也替你留了一块最酥脆的麦饼。
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">暖窖日几桩活计都出了岔子，你只分到一块热麦饼暖手。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_candle_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 4>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">暖窖日四桩活计圆满完成，你领到了 £6.50 全勤谢礼。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你领到了暖窖日的 £3.50 帮工补贴。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	暖窖日的补贴已经领过，只剩热闹的余温。
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<tiredness -2>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回孤儿院大厅歇息 (0:02)|Orphanage]]>><<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "orphanage">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回半日节令水牌 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

/* ==================== 2. 五月花柱集 (5月1日 · Maypole · 5段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Maypole 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
五月一日上午，公园中心草坪竖起了一根漆成白绿相间的桦木花柱。诺艾尔与莫奈正把十二条彩绸缎带系在柱顶花环上，然而春风吹乱了高处的绸带，有两条缎带缠在了树枝间。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回公园主径 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[踩上木梯解开高处彩绸 (0:07)|MP Festival Maypole 2]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_ribbon"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_ribbon"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[用长竹竿挑顺缠绕缎带 (0:07)|MP Festival Maypole 2]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_ribbon"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_ribbon"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Maypole 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
正午手风琴声响起，年轻街坊们每人牵起一条彩绸围着桦木柱交叉绕行。刚编到第三圈菱形花纹时，东侧一名学徒步点踏反，眼看整圈彩绸就要拧成死结。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退到草坪长椅边 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[旋身穿插替学徒带回步点 (0:06)|MP Festival Maypole 3]]>>
	<<if ($danceskill or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_dance"] to 1>><<stress -3>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_dance"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[轻拍手鼓帮众人稳住节拍 (0:06)|MP Festival Maypole 3]]>>
	<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_dance"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_dance"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Maypole 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "garden">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
花柱彩绸编好后，众人移步到公园花圃旁分编随身佩戴的铃兰与山楂花环。几只采蜜的野蜂围着花篮打转，把旁边帮忙的小女孩吓得不敢伸手。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[顺小径离开花圃 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[用薄荷叶清香引开野蜂 (0:06)|MP Festival Maypole 4]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_wreath"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_wreath"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[端起糖水碟移到远端树荫 (0:06)|MP Festival Maypole 4]]>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_wreath"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_wreath"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Maypole 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
午后阳光穿过新绿树冠，白桦花柱被红白相间的彩绸裹得如同盛开的花束。
<<if $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_ribbon"] is 1 and $mpFestival3Clues["maypole_dance"] is 1>>
莫奈用画笔速写下花柱全景，诺艾尔也将一顶沾着露珠的铃兰花冠戴在你头上。<span class="green">周围响起一片欢快的掌声。</span>
<<else>>
彩绸顶端虽有些松散，但缀上山楂花枝后依然鲜亮喜庆。<span class="teal">春风拂过面颊令人神清气爽。</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回公园出口 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[到长桌旁分饮接骨木花茶 (0:05)|MP Festival Maypole 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Maypole 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
半日花集散场前，商会执事将布置花柱的红封分给帮忙的人。你喝着清凉微甜的花茶，口袋里还揣着诺艾尔塞给你的铃兰香囊。
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">花柱集几桩活计都出了岔子，你只分到一块热麦饼暖手。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_maypole_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 4>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">花柱集四桩活计圆满完成，你领到了 £6.50 全勤谢礼。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你领到了花柱集的 £3.50 帮工补贴。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	花柱集的补贴已经领过，只剩热闹的余温。
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<tiredness -2>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开公园返回街区 (0:02)|Park]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "park">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回半日节令水牌 (0:03)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

/* ==================== 3. 初穗尝新会 (8月1日 · Firstsheaf · 5段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Firstsheaf 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
八月一日清晨，向阳坡地的头茬春麦刚满金黄。按照初穗尝新会的规矩，亚历克斯正准备割下第一束麦穗试磨新面，却发现打谷场边的石磨转轴干涩卡顿，还没筛完头斗麦粒就停了。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回农田主路 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[给石磨木轴涂抹熟猪油 (0:07)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 2]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_mill"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_mill"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[与亚历克斯合力抬正磨盘 (0:07)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 2]]>>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_mill"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_mill"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Firstsheaf 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
新磨出的头茬麦粉带着浓郁的阳光麦香。正要把麦粉装袋送往收成街烤制尝新圆饼时，几只林间斑鸠落进晒麦席啄食麦粒，赶得太急又容易踩翻竹匾。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回打谷场边 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[撒一把碎谷壳引走斑鸠 (0:06)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 3]]>>
	<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_birds"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_birds"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[摇动系铃麻绳护住竹匾 (0:06)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 3]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_birds"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_birds"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Firstsheaf 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
午间收成街酒馆后厨的铁壁炉烧得通红，新麦粉揉入黄油与迷迭香后推进烤膛。掌柜同时煮起了一桶无醇头锅麦芽饮，让你帮忙看准火候撇去浮沫。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[走出酒馆回成街 (0:02)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[用细铜勺撇净麦芽浮沫 (0:07)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 4]]>>
	<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_bake"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_bake"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[转动长柄木铲均匀烘烤 (0:07)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 4]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_bake"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_bake"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Firstsheaf 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
第一炉金黄酥脆的尝新大圆饼端上街口木桌，农夫与街坊们围拢过来掰饼尝鲜。
<<if $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_mill"] is 1 and $mpFestival3Clues["sheaf_bake"] is 1>>
新麦粉细润弹牙，配着琥珀色的清甜麦芽饮，连挑剔的老磨坊主都竖起了大拇指。<span class="green">今年的头茬尝新会办得格外红火。</span>
<<else>>
圆饼边角虽烤得略硬了些，蘸着温热的麦芽饮依然香气十足。<span class="teal">热闹的欢笑声传遍了整条收成街。</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回收成街路口 (0:02)|Harvest Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "pub">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[与亚历克斯清点结余新麦 (0:05)|MP Festival Firstsheaf 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP Festival Firstsheaf 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
傍晚微风吹过麦浪，亚历克斯把一束编成平安结的金黄初穗别在你衣襟上，又将磨坊与酒馆凑出的尝新红封塞进你手心。
<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) lte 0>>
	<span class="teal">尝新会几桩活计都出了岔子，你只分到一块热麦饼暖手。</span>
<<elseif window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("festival_firstsheaf_reward")>>
	<<if ($mpFestScore or 0) gte 4>>
		<<money 650>><span class="gold">尝新会四桩活计圆满完成，你领到了 £6.50 全勤谢礼。</span>
	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你领到了尝新会的 £3.50 帮工补贴。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	尝新会的补贴已经领过，只剩热闹的余温。
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<tiredness -2>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[沿田埂返回农田 (0:02)|Farmland]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "farm">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回半日节令水牌 (0:04)|MP Town Festivals 3 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

/* ==================== 4. 封港修船日 (11月22日 · Careen · 5段) ==================== */

:: MP Festival Careen 1 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<effects>><<set $mpFestScore to 0>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
十一月下旬风暴季来临前，旧港干船坞迎来了封港修船日。老船长与维斯正指挥水手把近海渔船架上木滑台，准备刮除船底积了一年的藤壶与海牡蛎。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回梅尔街路口 (0:02)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<fisticon>><<link [[握长柄平铲刮除龙骨藤壶 (0:08)|MP Festival Careen 2]]>>
	<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11500 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_scrape"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_scrape"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 8>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[用钢丝刷清理螺旋桨叶槽 (0:07)|MP Festival Careen 2]]>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_scrape"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_scrape"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Careen 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
刮净的船底木板露出几道细微的渗水接缝。船坞边的铁锅里正熬着滚烫的松脂与焦油，必须趁热将浸过桐油的麻丝捻进木板缝里。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回船坞石阶 (0:02)|Mer Street]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[用木槌凿刀将油麻捻入缝 (0:07)|MP Festival Careen 3]]>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_pitch"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_pitch"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[看管铁锅火候刷匀热松脂 (0:07)|MP Festival Careen 3]]>>
	<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_pitch"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_pitch"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 7>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Careen 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
修补完船底后，众人来到栈桥边将备用麻缆盘进防潮帆布仓。一阵强劲的西北风突然掠过港湾，挂在桅杆顶端的防风测向旗绳扣脱开，眼看就要被吹落海中。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回码头主栈道 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<link [[攀上副桅杆挽住旗绳活扣 (0:06)|MP Festival Careen 4]]>>
	<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 250>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_flag"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_flag"] to 0>><<stress 3>><<pain 1>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<link [[用带钩缆绳在甲板抄住旗角 (0:06)|MP Festival Careen 4]]>>
	<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_flag"] to 1>><<set $mpFestScore to ($mpFestScore or 0) + 1>><<stress -2>><<else>><<set $mpFestival3Clues["careen_flag"] to 0>><<stress 3>><</if>>
	<<pass 6>>
<</link>>

:: MP Festival Careen 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>>
<<set $mpFestival3Clues to ($mpFestival3Clues or {})>>
夕阳沉入铅灰色的冬海，船坞里的大小船只都涂上了乌亮防渗的松脂焦油。
<<if $mpFestival3Clues["careen_scrape"] is 1 and $mpFestival3Clues["careen_pitch"] is 1>>
老船长用木槌敲了敲严丝合缝的船底，满意地让人搬出煨在炭火上的红糖朗姆姜茶。<span class="green">整排船只都做好了越冬防风准备。</span>
<<else>>
虽然补刷焦油多费了些工夫，总算赶在天黑前把全部船底封妥。<span class="teal">水手们围在火桶旁烘烤着湿冷的手套。</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[先回码头步道 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[到避风棚分饮滚烫姜茶 (0:05)|MP Festival Careen 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

