	<<else>>
		<<money 350>><span class="gold">你领到了修船日的 £3.50 帮工补贴。</span>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	修船日的补贴已经领过，只剩热闹的余温。
<</if>>
<<stress -5>><<tiredness -2>><<lstress>><<ltiredness>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开避风棚返回码头 (0:02)|Docks]]>><<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
